# Documented escape hatch for Trivy image scanning.
#
# The CI gate fails the build on HIGH/CRITICAL vulnerabilities that have a fix
# available (`--ignore-unfixed`). If an unavoidable, fixable CVE ever appears in
# a base-image package before an upstream patch lands, add its CVE id below
# (one per line) with a comment explaining why and a review date, e.g.:
#
#   CVE-2025-XXXXX  # distroless base; no fix upstream yet; re-check 2026-01-01
#
# Keep this file empty by default — every entry is a knowingly accepted risk.
